<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani bourse shut for religious holiday.</title>
<headline>Pakistani bourse shut for religious holiday.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange was closed on Monday for a local religious holiday and will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 100-share index closed 19.46 points, or 1.33 percent, lower at 1,441.12 on Sunday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
